{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["provider","destination account","verified controller"],"summary":"A review note recommends preserving the original statement and ledger exports, obtaining provider account records, requesting login and device telemetry, and checking whether the destination account has a verified controller. These are proposed verification steps, not completed investigative results.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-review-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/review/verification-plan"}]}]}